.TH ifg-branch 1  "ifg-branch 0.9.0"
.SH NAME
ifg\-branch \- Work with repository branches
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg branch\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Work with repository branches
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-branch\-delete(1)
Delete a branch (asks for confirmation unless \-\-yes)
.TP
ifg\-branch\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.9.0
